            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l﹝负栋之柱〕支撑房屋大梁的柱子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                706,
                798,
                724
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m﹝磷磷〕有棱角的样子。这里形容钉头突出。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                722,
                843,
                739
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n﹝庾〕谷仓。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                738,
                648,
                755
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g﹝收藏〕指收藏的金玉珍宝等物。下文的“经营”“精英”也指金玉珍宝等物。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                787,
                478,
                819
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o﹝九土〕九州。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                755,
                660,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
