            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l﹝判〕决定，确定。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                609,
                675,
                626
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m﹝以地事秦……火不灭〕语出《史记·魏世家》和《战国策·魏策》。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                626,
                892,
                658
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n﹝迁灭〕灭亡。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                657,
                647,
                675
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o﹝与嬴〕亲附秦国。与，亲附、亲近。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                674,
                788,
                690
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "p﹝远略〕长远的谋略。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                690,
                692,
                707
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "q﹝至丹以荆卿为计，始速祸焉〕等到燕太子丹用荆卿（刺秦王）作为（对付秦国的）策略，才招致祸患。《史记》记载，荆轲刺秦王未成，秦王大怒，发兵灭燕。荆卿，荆轲，即下文提到的“刺客”速，招致。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                707,
                890,
                787
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j﹝举以予人〕拿来送给别人。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                851,
                312,
                868
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k﹝奉之弥繁，侵之愈急〕六国送给秦越多，秦侵犯六国越厉害。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                866,
                467,
                900
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "r﹝李牧〕赵国大将，曾几次打退秦军。前229年，秦将王翦攻赵，李牧率兵抵抗，赵王中了秦的反间计，杀李牧。第二年，王翦破赵军，虏赵王，灭赵国。下文的“邯郸为郡”即指秦灭赵，把赵国都城邯郸一带改为秦的邯郸郡。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                787,
                892,
                866
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "s﹝洎（jì）〕及，等到。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                866,
                690,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
